# Timestamped run artifacts from these scripts (results/<name>-<timestamp>.md
# plus a same-named raw-log directory) are local, ephemeral outputs, not
# permanent history -- see ../docs/06-lessons-learned.md and
# ../docs/04-implementation-plan.md for the durable, curated record of what
# these runs found. Keep the directory itself (via .gitkeep) so a fresh
# checkout has somewhere for the scripts to write without needing to
# `mkdir -p` be the first thing every script does.
results/*
!results/.gitkeep
